   "missionStatement": "TIGMA stands for \"Today I Give My All.\" TIGMA is devoted to driving revenue for Mountaineer student-athletes and positioning Appalachian State University Athletics to have great success in the next chapter of college athletics. Through TIGMA, the most passionate Mountaineer fans and businesses can engage with Appalachian State University Athletics and its student-athletes like never before and ensure our winning ways continue in Appalachian State University for years to come. By becoming a TIGMA member and/or and partnering with TIGMA to grow your business, you are contributing to the long-term success of Appalachian State University Athletics.",
